516 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 190 0 R/E(An algorithm is in-place when it rearranges data inside the original list using only O\(1\) auxiliary storage. Standard Merge Sort is out-of-place because its merge step creates temporary left/right sublists that grow with n.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

